  "title": "Beef Heart Braised in Wine",
  "description": "This strongly flavored organ meat is not for everybody, but those who enjoy it might like to try this version, prepared with carrots, potatoes, and onions in red wine sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Eileen Mintz"
  ],
